              "id": "text-16",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy MP35N® | UNS# R30035 is a unique, age-hardenable high-performance nickel based alloy that demonstrates high strength, good toughness, and good ductility. These characteristics make MP35N® exceptional in terms to stress resistance in regards to cracking and crevicing. Additionally, MP35N® also maintains excellent corrosion resistance in chloride solutions, mineral acids, hydrogen-sulfides, and in saltwater. Because of these traits, MP35N® is often used in the Oil & Gas industries, medical instrumentation and dental devices, fasteners, chemical applications, food processing equipment, and other similar applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy MP35N® Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 5758, AMS 5844, AMS 5845"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASTM: ASTM F-562"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Please find Titanium Industries’ selection of [Nickel Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-nickel-alloy-round-bar) here."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
